  "body": "Small process change, at the maintainer's request (2026-11-10: \"find all MCP tickets and make P1\", then \"Add area:mcp to all of em\" and \"fix in a small PR\").\n\n- **AGENTS.md**, \"Commands ship with an MCP tool\": every MCP issue (an `MCP:` title, or work on `crates/app/src/mcp/` or the camcraft-mcp skill) carries `area:mcp` and is `P1`.\n- **`.claude/skills/camcraft-mcp/SKILL.md`**: its two quotes of that rule now name the labels.\n- **`.claude/PROCESS_VERSION`**: 4 → 5. Announced on #681 when this merges.\n\nThe `area:mcp` label already exists and is on all 10 open MCP issues.\n\nWhat a fork must do: sync process files (PROCESS_VERSION 5) and label new `MCP:` issues `P1` + `area:mcp`.\n\nChangelog: none\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
